From 8ddbc8c039bcb4edfd7b838412e7ec79df86c412 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LECH OS <dev@lech-os.invalid>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 08:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Slovak texts of the settings added by the base

LECH OS on the GrapheneOS base (ADR-0012): the settings the base adds
(exploit protection, USB-C port, duress password, clipboard access,
carrier overrides, network location...) had English texts only, e.g.
"Allow access to Android/obb folder" (owner, Pixel 9, 15. 11. 2026).
All of them get a Slovak translation. Servers of GrapheneOS keep their
name: the base uses them. The duress password text names LECH OS, and
the Play Integrity text no longer speaks for GrapheneOS.
---
 res/values-sk/strings_ext.xml | 235 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 res/values/strings_ext.xml    |   4 +-
 2 files changed, 237 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 res/values-sk/strings_ext.xml

diff --git a/res/values-sk/strings_ext.xml b/res/values-sk/strings_ext.xml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..bb1c103
--- /dev/null
+++ b/res/values-sk/strings_ext.xml
@@ -0,0 +1,235 @@
